width: 350px; display: block; margin: 0 auto;\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    \n    <div class=\"doc-info-col\">\n      <h1 style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 38px; color: var(--pink); margin-bottom: 5px;\">DR GIRISH AC</h1>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-gray); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n        MBBS from JJM Medical College, Davanagere, India. Post Graduation in MS (General Surgery) from JN Medical College, Belgaum, India. Super Specialty Course MCh in (Plastic Surgery) from one of the reputed Medical College - Bangalore Medical College &amp; Research Institute, India.\n      </p>\n      \n      <span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #ffe6ef; color: var(--pink); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px; margin-bottom: 25px;\">Bengaluru</span>\n      \n      \n      <div class=\"doc-specs\" style=\"border-top: 1px solid #f0e1e6; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0e1e6; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n        \n        <div class=\"spec-row\" style=\"display: flex; padding: 15px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0e1e6;\">\n          <div class=\"spec-label\" style=\"width: 120px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-dark);\">Speciality</div>\n          <div class=\"spec-value\" style=\"flex: 1; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-gray);\">Cosmetic And Plastic Surgeon</div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"spec-row\" style=\"display: flex; padding: 15px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0e1e6;\">\n          <div class=\"spec-label\" style=\"width: 120px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-dark);\">Education</div>\n          <div class=\"spec-value\" style=\"flex: 1; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-gray); line-height: 1.5;\">\n            MBBS from JJM Medical College, Davanagere, India.<br>\n            Post Graduation in MS (General Surgery) from JN Medical College, Belgaum, India.<br>\n            Super Specialty Course MCh in (Plastic Surgery) from Bangalore Medical College.\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"spec-row\" style=\"display: flex; padding: 15px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0e1e6;\">\n          <div class=\"spec-label\" style=\"width: 120px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-dark);\">Experience</div>\n          <div class=\"spec-value\" style=\"flex: 1; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-gray);\">25+ years</div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"spec-row\" style=\"display: flex; padding: 15px 0;\">\n          <div class=\"spec-label\" style=\"width: 120px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-dark);\">Mobile</div>\n          <div class=\"spec-value\" style=\"flex: 1; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-gray);\"><a href=\"tel:9480281652\" style=\"color: var(--text-gray); text-decoration: underline;\">9480281652</a></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      \n      <div class=\"doc-bio\" style=\"font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-gray); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n        <p style=\"margin-bottom: 15px;\">Dr. Girish A C - Leading Cosmetic &amp; Plastic Surgeon in Bangalore. Dr. Girish A C is a board-certified plastic surgeon in Bangalore, renowned for his commitment to transforming lives through advanced cosmetic and plastic surgery. With over 25 plus years of expertise, he has successfully performed more than 10,000 cosmetic procedures, earning him a reputation as one of the best cosmetic surgeons in Bangalore.</p>\n        \n        <p>His greatest satisfaction comes from helping patients look and feel their best, enhancing both their appearance and confidence. Dr. Girish A C is affiliated with esteemed organizations such as the Association of Plastic Surgeons of India (APSI), Indian Association of Aesthetic Plastic Surgeons (IAAPS), and the International Society of Aesthetic Plastic Surgery (ISAPS).</p>\n      </div>\n      \n      \n      <div class=\"doc-actions\" style